                    {
                        "form_id": "155753d7-1caa-4a75-a520-02e461c87682",
                        "entry_id": "3563f6db-4391-31be-858d-82fa51de36c9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "инду́кциях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "865523c6-1a72-3a6c-a557-4cb59298777a",
                        "entry_id": "3563f6db-4391-31be-858d-82fa51de36c9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "филос. метод рассуждения от частного к общему"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "22b152a5-236f-4ea7-b083-301ca531600c",
                                "sense_id": "865523c6-1a72-3a6c-a557-4cb59298777a",
                                "text": "Постижение законов природы возможно путем анализа и обобщения отдельных проявлений, то есть исходя из индукции."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4db337a8-d3ce-4338-a6f4-99ae86ba62aa",
                                "sense_id": "865523c6-1a72-3a6c-a557-4cb59298777a",
                                "text": "Делая индукцию, мы знаем, что делаем, основываясь на постоянстве некоторых законов и явлений, но допуская также и нарушения."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cc5bd829-28fa-3a7b-a94c-d5db16b219e7",
                        "entry_id": "3563f6db-4391-31be-858d-82fa51de36c9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "матем. метод доказательства для последовательности натуральных чисел либо объектов, однозначно занумерованных натуральными числами"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c03d2cb1-cf37-352e-97c5-8703b0959ea8",
                        "entry_id": "3563f6db-4391-31be-858d-82fa51de36c9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "физ. возникновение полей и т. п. под действием изменения внешних условий"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "09ee55e5-be0c-48e0-ad85-bc059df53448",
                                "sense_id": "c03d2cb1-cf37-352e-97c5-8703b0959ea8",
                                "text": "Мы познакомились также с явлением индукции; оно состоит в том, что движение магнитного поля около проводника возбуждает в нём электродвижущую силу…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5224e3c7-8bcc-4c9a-a565-e11d972f1bce",
                        "source_entry_id": "3563f6db-4391-31be-858d-82fa51de36c9",
                        "target_lang_word": "induction",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "induction",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6d7525e-97ba-367e-9415-e6b744bc3e3e",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c00188a-9408-4a05-960a-353582cedd5b",
                                                "sense_id": "a6d7525e-97ba-367e-9415-e6b744bc3e3e",
                                                "text": "I know not you; nor am I well pleased to make this time, as the affair now stands, the induction of your acquaintance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "709db441-6bbc-4156-a0af-197c492c0f07",
                                                "sense_id": "a6d7525e-97ba-367e-9415-e6b744bc3e3e",
                                                "text": "These promises are fair, the parties sure, / And our induction full of prosperous hope."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "afa312d8-da59-3e68-984f-0a714d0ed2d1",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducting.",
                                            "A formal ceremony in which a person is appointed to an office or into military service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66aa73c2-1506-4523-bbb6-df72b8dc9784",
                                                "sense_id": "afa312d8-da59-3e68-984f-0a714d0ed2d1",
                                                "text": "[Strom] Thurmond also condemned [Bayard] Rustin for having refusing ^([sic]) military induction as a conscientious objector."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e536404c-4f03-398a-8f50-f01c3d42ed3e",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducting.",
                                            "The process of showing a newcomer around a place where they will work or study."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56ea72ba-bd8e-3fae-ab38-b880df5ccbfb",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a6781f0-579b-49df-a8b5-47f8f2691747",
                                                "sense_id": "56ea72ba-bd8e-3fae-ab38-b880df5ccbfb",
                                                "text": "One of the first examples of the immunogenicity of recombinantly derived antibodies was with murine anti-CD3 monoclonal antibody (OKT3) used in the induction of immunosupression after organ transplantation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c9ab259-aa9d-35ca-87cc-75e95995fcc3",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducing.",
                                            "Generation of an electric current by a varying magnetic field."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94619a25-b929-314e-86af-babd2166a2d2",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducing.",
                                            "Derivation of general principles from specific instances."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a80fc40-ebe6-4b5c-9fa7-beaa0636181d",
                                                "sense_id": "94619a25-b929-314e-86af-babd2166a2d2",
                                                "text": "Meronym: abstraction"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c625248-a721-4571-b92f-303064674ca4",
                                                "sense_id": "94619a25-b929-314e-86af-babd2166a2d2",
                                                "text": "For the most part they contented themselves with repeating a few familiar facts or adding a few fresh theories ; they did not attempt a wide induction on the basis of a systematic collection and classification of the evidence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6590584-46b3-3fab-a561-5329c182c224",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducing.",
                                            "A method of proof of a theorem by first proving it for a specific case (often an integer; usually 0 or 1) and showing that, if it is true for one case then it must be true for the next."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b483a3c-57b4-3fe2-870c-19e66e13fb53",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducing.",
                                            "Use of rumors to twist and complicate the plot of a play or to narrate in a way that does not have to state truth nor fact within the play."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91a0253b-5492-3220-b8d9-8ef9e1cbea3b",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducing.",
                                            "Given a group of cells that emits or displays a substance, the influence of this substance on the fate of a second group of cells."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ca99215-d628-33c9-8f43-18bb464a2f5f",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba21542-4055-3dd8-9039-7dd0ed3a48e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of inducing.",
                                            "The delivery of air to the cylinders of an internal combustion piston engine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
